@startuml
title III-07 - Customer shopping cart, ordering and payOS payment

autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Customer
boundary "Customer Portal" as Web
control "Order API" as API
database "CRM Database" as DB
participant "payOS API" as PayOS
participant "Payment Timeout Scheduler" as Job

== Cart management ==

Customer -> Web: Add, edit or remove cart item
Web -> API: PUT /api/cart
API -> DB: Save cart changes
DB --> API: Cart saved
API --> Web: Cart summary
Web --> Customer: Show updated cart

== Create order and reserve stock ==

Customer -> Web: Confirm address and payment method
Web -> API: POST /api/orders\n(cart, address, paymentMethod, optional promotion code (promoCode))
API -> DB: Start checkout transaction
API -> DB: Lock products and read current stock
API -> DB: Validate promotion existence, active/validity period,\neligibility conditions and remaining usage

alt Insufficient stock or invalid item
    API -> DB: Roll back checkout transaction
    API --> Web: 409 OUT_OF_STOCK / 400 INVALID_CART
    Web --> Customer: Show checkout error
else Promotion invalid, expired, ineligible or exhausted
    API -> DB: Roll back checkout transaction\n(no order created)
    API --> Web: 400 PROMO_NOT_APPLICABLE
    Web --> Customer: Show promotion error
else Stock available
    API -> API: Calculate subtotal, discountAmount and finalAmount\n=max(subtotal - discountAmount, 0)\nusing VND half-up rounding before persistence and payment request;\nno promotion means discountAmount=0
    API -> API: Prepare PENDING_PAYMENT order in memory\n(with promotion code and rounded calculated amounts)
    API -> API: Generate unique numeric orderCode
    API -> DB: Persist PENDING_PAYMENT order with orderCode\nand rounded calculated amounts\n(Order.totalAmount = canonical payable amount)
    alt Accepted promotion code
        API -> DB: Reserve promotion usage atomically and concurrency-safely\n(keyed to pending order identity)\nstate RESERVED
    else No promotion code
        API -> DB: Keep discountAmount=0 and create no promotion reservation
    end
    API -> DB: Add order items
    API -> DB: Reserve inventory atomically
    API -> DB: Finish checkout transaction
    API -> PayOS: POST /v2/payment-requests\n(orderCode, amount = finalAmount, items, returnUrl, cancelUrl, expiredAt, signature)
    PayOS --> API: checkoutUrl, paymentLinkId, status PENDING
    API --> Web: 201 paymentUrl = checkoutUrl
    Web -> PayOS: Redirect to checkoutUrl
    Customer -> PayOS: Scan VietQR or complete bank transfer

    == Return/cancel URL: display only ==

    PayOS --> Web: Redirect returnUrl/cancelUrl\n(code, status, orderCode, paymentLinkId)
    Web -> API: GET /api/payments/payos/return
    API --> Web: Display payment or cancellation result
    Web --> Customer: Show result
    note right of Web
      Return URL and cancelUrl are for display only.
      They do not finalize the order.
    end note

    == Webhook: source of truth ==

    PayOS ->> API: POST /api/payments/payos/webhook\nJSON payload + signature
    API -> API: Verify HMAC-SHA256 signature
    API -> API: Verify orderCode and data.code

    alt Invalid signature, orderCode or data.code
        API --> PayOS: HTTP 400 Invalid webhook
    else Valid webhook data
        API -> DB: Start payment update transaction
        API -> DB: Lock and load payment/order
        API -> DB: Load stored canonical payable amount\n(Order.totalAmount)
        API -> API: Compare received amount with stored canonical amount

        alt Received amount mismatch
            API -> DB: Roll back payment update transaction\n(do not update payment or order)
            API --> PayOS: HTTP 400 Amount mismatch
        else Amount matches canonical payable amount
            API -> DB: Record or identify webhook event\nDatabase prevents duplicate event

            alt Duplicate webhook callback
                API -> DB: No-op because event was processed
                API -> DB: Finish payment update
                API --> PayOS: HTTP 200 OK
            else New webhook callback
                API -> DB: Check payment is PENDING and order is PENDING_PAYMENT
                alt Payment is already PAID/FAILED/CANCELLED/EXPIRED\nor order is already CONFIRMED/CANCELLED
                    API -> DB: No-op because payment/order is already finalized or cancelled
                    API -> DB: Finish payment update
                    API --> PayOS: HTTP 200 OK
                else Payment is PENDING and order is PENDING_PAYMENT
                    alt success=true and data.code=00
                        API -> DB: Update payment PAID
                        API -> DB: Update order CONFIRMED
                        alt Existing promotion reservation
                            API -> DB: Finalize promotion usage once\nRESERVED -> CONFIRMED
                            alt Promotion reservation already CONFIRMED or RELEASED
                                API -> DB: No-op promotion finalization
                            end
                        else No promotion reservation
                            API -> DB: No-op promotion finalization
                        end
                        API -> DB: Finish payment update
                        API --> PayOS: HTTP 200 OK
                    else Failed, cancelled or expired payment
                        API -> DB: Update payment FAILED/CANCELLED/EXPIRED
                        API -> DB: Update order CANCELLED
                        API -> DB: Release reserved stock once
                        alt Existing promotion reservation
                            API -> DB: Release promotion usage once\nRESERVED -> RELEASED
                            alt Promotion reservation already RELEASED or CONFIRMED\nor cleanup race already handled it
                                API -> DB: No-op promotion release
                            end
                        else No promotion reservation
                            API -> DB: No-op promotion release
                        end
                        API -> DB: Finish payment update
                        API --> PayOS: HTTP 200 OK
                    end
                end
            end
        end
    end
end

== Expired pending-payment cleanup ==

Job -> API: Run every 5 minutes
API -> DB: Start cleanup transaction
API -> DB: Load expired PENDING_PAYMENT orders with lock\nProcess batches without overlap
alt Expired orders found
    alt Order is still PENDING_PAYMENT
        API -> DB: Update payment EXPIRED
        API -> DB: Update order CANCELLED
        API -> DB: Release reserved stock once
        alt Existing promotion reservation
            API -> DB: Release promotion usage once\nRESERVED -> RELEASED
            alt Cleanup race or promotion reservation already RELEASED/CONFIRMED
                API -> DB: No-op promotion release
            end
        else No promotion reservation
            API -> DB: No-op promotion release
        end
    else Cleanup race or order already finalized/cancelled
        API -> DB: No-op cleanup
    end
    API -> DB: Finish cleanup transaction
else No expired orders
    API -> DB: Finish cleanup transaction
end

note over API,PayOS
  payOS has no separate Sandbox/Staging environment.
  Test with a verified account and a small real transaction.
  Keep PAYOS_CLIENT_ID, PAYOS_API_KEY and PAYOS_CHECKSUM_KEY
  on the backend only.
end note

@enduml
